    # soph "The ability comes from a lineage of \"Grimm Hunters\" who fight to keep humanity safe from the supernatural creatures of the world."
    soph "这种能力源自「格林猎人」家族，他们致力于保护人类，使其免受世上超自然生物的侵害。"

